  "body": "podliner v2.4.0\n\nan option to mark episodes played only at the very end (#40).\n\n## new\n\n- **`:played-at end`.** by default an episode counts as played 30 seconds before its end or at 90% (5 seconds or 98% for episodes up to a minute). with `:played-at end` it only counts once playback reaches the end. `:played-at near-end` goes back to the default and `:played-at` shows what is set. the choice is kept across restarts, as `MarkPlayedAtEnd` in `appsettings.json`. thanks to richardHangHimself for the report.\n"
